### Passo 3 - agora TODAS as rotas (menos /health e login) pedem token de ADMIN.
### Rode primeiro o bloco 0 (login). O token dele e usado automaticamente nos outros blocos.
### Passo 2 - testes do modulo de usuarios (extensao "REST Client" do VS Code)
### Clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco. Rode na ordem.

@url = http://localhost:7505

### 0) Login do ADMIN (deve dar 200 com access_token)
# @name login
POST {{url}}/auth/login/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hemovida.com",
  "senha": "hemoLBR*&senac"
}

### 0b) Sem token (deve dar 401)
GET {{url}}/usuarios

### 0c) Senha errada (deve dar 401)
POST {{url}}/auth/login/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin.teste@hemovida.com", "senha": "errada" }

### 1) Saude da API
GET {{url}}/health

### 2) Criar enfermeira (deve dar 201)
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "perfil": "ENFERMAGEM",
  "nomeCompleto": "Ana Teste",
  "email": "ana.teste@hemovida.com",
  "senha": "Senha12345"
}

### 3) Repetir o mesmo e-mail (deve dar 409)
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "perfil": "ENFERMAGEM",
  "nomeCompleto": "Ana Teste",
  "email": "ana.teste@hemovida.com",
  "senha": "Senha12345"
}

### 4) Gestor de demanda SEM hospital (deve dar 400)
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "perfil": "GESTOR_DEMANDA",
  "nomeCompleto": "Gestor Teste",
  "email": "gestor.teste@hemovida.com",
  "senha": "Senha12345"
}

### 5) Gestor de demanda COM hospital (deve dar 201)
POST {{url}}/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
  "perfil": "GESTOR_DEMANDA",
  "nomeCompleto": "Gestor Teste",
  "email": "gestor.teste@hemovida.com",
  "senha": "Senha12345",
  "hospitalId": 1
}

### 6) Listar (deve mostrar so a equipe, sem senha)
GET {{url}}/usuarios?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 7) Buscar um (troque o 1 pelo id que apareceu)
GET {{url}}/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 8) Editar nome
PUT {{url}}/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{ "nomeCompleto": "Ana Teste Editada" }

### 9) Desativar (204, a linha NAO e apagada)
DELETE {{url}}/usuarios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### 10) Reativar
PUT {{url}}/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{ "ativo": true }

### ===== PASSO 5 =====
### Antes: ponha no .env  SERVICE_KEY=(48+ caracteres)  e  MS1_BASE_URL=http://localhost:7501
### e reinicie a API. Troque SUA_SERVICE_KEY abaixo pelo mesmo valor.

### 11) Criar usuario DOADOR (chamada que o MS1 fara) - 201 e {"id": N}
POST {{url}}/internal/usuarios/doador
Content-Type: application/json
x-service-key: YQj51jlk9VdkkEjnM9XfbtRss4kqpXCRwrOVOZquVuxpmnNRUr2DwgWGOnkK7NF8

{ "cpf": "529.982.247-25", "nomeCompleto": "Maria Doadora Teste" }

### 12) Repetir (deve dar 200 e o MESMO id, sem duplicar)
POST {{url}}/internal/usuarios/doador
Content-Type: application/json
x-service-key: YQj51jlk9VdkkEjnM9XfbtRss4kqpXCRwrOVOZquVuxpmnNRUr2DwgWGOnkK7NF8

{ "cpf": "52998224725" }

### 13) Sem a chave (deve dar 401)
POST {{url}}/internal/usuarios/doador
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cpf": "52998224725" }

### 14) Login do doador. Enquanto o MS1 nao tiver o endpoint, o esperado e 503.
POST {{url}}/auth/login/doador
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cpf": "52998224725", "dataNascimento": "1990-05-17" }

### 15) Desativar o usuario doador (troque o 1 pelo id do bloco 11) - 204
POST {{url}}/internal/usuarios/9/desativar
x-service-key: YQj51jlk9VdkkEjnM9XfbtRss4kqpXCRwrOVOZquVuxpmnNRUr2DwgWGOnkK7NF8
